  "id": 1115,
  "description": "## ✨ Welcome to Lacuna ✨\n\nThe guild you&#039;re looking at right now is Lacunae Echo. The second guild of the Lacuna Community designed for upcoming players to the mid to end-game to continue their growth!\n\nWe&#039;re a team looking for people who want to be part of building something great together. We&#039;re focused on collaboration and teamwork, with members contributing to shared goals and making decisions as a group. Your voice matters here! 🗣️\n\n### 💬 What We&#039;re About\n\nWe play together, help each other, and grow as a team! We welcome contributors from all countries and nationalities. Feel free to ask questions, join raids, and enjoy the game with everyone! 🌍\n\n- Idle is a lifestyle 🌴\n- Discord is our primary method of communication, as a collaborative guild, we have polls and discussions to make decisions together. While Discord is not a requirement, it is highly suggested for the best experience. \n- Come fight alongside us! ⚔️\n\n\n### 📅 Raid Hours (Mon-Fri)\n\nWe&#039;re currently raiding Level 80, 5 days a week.\n\nRaids start at the first schedule below. The second raid will correlate to the second raid in the main guild to optimize timing and get people used to the schedule.\n\n- Starting Raid: ⌚ 7:00 AM PST | 10:00 AM EST ⌚\n\n\n### ⭐️Benefits\n- A community of helpful and fun people to chat and work towards common guild goals.\n- A Growth Guild System to learn and start from level 1 to eventually becoming powerful!\n- Teleportation to our guildhall location (discounted teleports).\n- A place to level, get help, chat and make new friends\n- Opportunity for growth with the parent guild for bonuses!\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n\n- Combat Level: +80 💪\n- Help with daily challenges! This will allow the guild to help level everyone!\n- Daily Activity: Idle ≠ AFK. Chat and hang out in Discord to make new friends. If you&#039;re inactive without telling anyone for over a week, you may be kicked.\n\n### 🏘️ Lacuna Community \n- Are you a lower combat level but still want to be part of this awesome crew? Come chat on our discord!\n     - Lacuna - CL92+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=937\n     - Lacunae Echo - CL80+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1115\n     - Tiny Lacunas - CL60+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1442\n     - Lacuna Academy - CL40+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1536\n     - Lacuna Resort - Retired/Snoozers : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1516\n\n🏰 Ready to join a community where your contributions make a real difference? All are welcome on our Discord to come say hi! 👇\n\n##### https://discord.gg/DQvSQNkPbp",
